The predicate function is the most flexible option. Here we style all numeric cells with a value
under 50:

::: {#f929ead7 .cell execution_count=18}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(
    GT(
        exibble[["num", "char", "currency", "row", "group"]],
        rowname_col="row",
        groupname_col="group"
    )
    .tab_style_body(
        style=style.fill(color="lightgreen"),
        fn=lambda x: x >= 0 and x < 50,
    )
)
```

