### Using a regex pattern

The `pattern=` argument matches against the string representation of each cell. `None` values are
skipped.

::: {#7f4b49f1 .cell execution_count=19}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(
    GT(
        exibble[["num", "char", "currency", "row", "group"]],
        rowname_col="row",
        groupname_col="group"
    )
    .tab_style_body(
        style=style.fill(color="lightyellow"),
        pattern="^[a-d]",
    )
)
```

